G|0|0|0|0|1|Parity ok, 1>=1 (reconcile capped to its one excerpt; discrepancy's named-skeptic counts as 1). Both connectives accurate: Tyndale's "govern"/doxology lines back the calendrical+doxological framing; SAB astrology.html (WebFetch-confirmed) makes exactly the "for signs" vs abomination argument attributed to Wells, who is real and fairly represented. Deeper-learning flagged: K&D is a real PD work that does comment on Gen 1:14's signs (portents, weather prognostication, seasons) but three independent fetches (biblehub, worthy.bible, search-snippet quote, plus its Deut 18:10-14 note) show it never draws the "distinguishing...from the divinatory abuse condemned in the Law" contrast the pd_work note claims — that reconciling move is not actually in K&D; note overclaims what the cited work argues.